{"client":"claude-desktop","transport":"mcacp","wiring":"direct","prereqs":"tau installed and configured — `tau doctor` reports an ok provider and API key; Node.js with `npx` on the PATH Claude Desktop sees — the bridge runs as `npx -y mcacp` (or install it once with `npm i -g mcacp`)","setup":"tau setup --client claude-desktop --yes","config_dir":"~/.config/Claude","settings_path":"~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json","snippet_path":"~/.config/tau/snippets/claude-desktop.jsonc","bridge_path":"~/.config/mcacp/mcacp.json","verify":"install mcacp (npm i -g mcacp or npx), restart Claude Desktop, and find tau's tools under the mcacp server","doctor_check":"client_claude_desktop","docs":"https://github.com/javimosch/tau/blob/master/docs/clients/claude-desktop.md"}
